__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

# Credentials — never commit
.env

# Test run output / build artifacts
#
# Raw recordings land in recordings/ on every run and are never committed —
# these patterns are deliberately non-recursive so a stray run can't sweep
# itself into the repo. Recordings that back the published walkthrough are
# moved by hand into recordings/published/, which IS tracked. Publishing a
# recording is therefore always a deliberate act, never a side effect.
recordings/*.webm
recordings/*.mp4
report.html
test_results.png
